From 30c3207a3d96b8af92daacc61c06b887fd30d615 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: amber <amber@flourish.ch>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 18:54:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/16] Preserve messages after remote deletion requests

Add an opt-in privacy setting that keeps ordinary incoming chat messages when their sender deletes them for everyone. Administrator deletions, stories, and our own outgoing messages continue to use Signal's standard deletion path.

Kept messages receive a local-only Deletion requested marker. The marker is deliberately outside Signal's backup schema.

Signed-off-by: amber <amber@flourish.ch>
